# Cursor Implementation Guide
# Feature: FR-001 - Workspace Management
# Version: 1.0
# Product: Flox

---

# Overview

Implement the Workspace Management module for Flox.

A Workspace is the highest-level container within Flox.

Everything belongs to a workspace.

Examples:

- Personal
- Startup
- Client
- Business
- School
- Research

Every authenticated user must have at least one workspace.

---

# Objectives

Build a complete Workspace Management system including:

- Create Workspace
- List Workspaces
- Update Workspace
- Archive Workspace
- Delete Workspace (Soft Delete)
- Restore Workspace
- Workspace Dashboard
- Workspace Settings

The implementation must be production-ready.

