---

# Engineering Principle

Do NOT think of a Workspace as just another table.

Think of it as an isolated operating environment.

Every AI memory

Every file

Every prompt

Every project

Every automation

Every agent

Lives inside a workspace.

The workspace is the security boundary, context boundary, billing boundary, and AI memory boundary.

Everything starts here.